  output: canonical diagram; frame -> 1px rectangular border with 1-cell bg gap to children; blob -> single fg pixel; siblings separated by 1 bg cell; outside blobs get 3x3 bg slot adjacent to outermost frame
  bg_padding: drawing occupies most of the grid; remaining area is bg; min 0 padding on some sides [observed]

